{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42442","headline":"送德林郎中学士赴东府 · 萧彧","name":"送德林郎中学士赴东府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离情折杨柳，此别异春哉。\n含露东篱艳，泛香南浦杯。\n惜持行次赠，留插醉中回。\n暮齿如能制，玉山甘判颓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧彧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42442.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42442","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}